{"type": "project", "schema_version": 1, "topic": "消息队列为什么会重复投递？", "audience": "了解服务和数据库、刚接触消息队列的开发者", "target_seconds": 180, "post": {"title": "消息处理成功了，为什么还会重投？三分钟讲清 ACK 和幂等", "description": "从一笔多发十积分的订单出发，看消息何时确认、为什么会重投、怎样用唯一键和事务把积分限定为加一次。示例按 RabbitMQ 手动确认和 PostgreSQL 积分流水讲解。", "tags": ["消息队列", "RabbitMQ", "幂等", "PostgreSQL", "后端"]}, "sources": [{"id": "ack", "title": "RabbitMQ · Consumer Acknowledgements and Publisher Confirms", "url": "https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/confirms#automatic-requeueing"}, {"id": "retry", "title": "RabbitMQ · Reliability and Data Safety", "url": "https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/reliability"}, {"id": "insert", "title": "PostgreSQL · INSERT / ON CONFLICT", "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-insert.html"}, {"id": "transactions", "title": "PostgreSQL · Transactions", "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/tutorial-transactions.html"}]}
{"type": "scene", "id": "intro", "kind": "html", "title": "一笔订单，两次加分"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "expected", "scene_id": "intro", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 3870, "text": "小林只下了一次订单，应该收到十积分。", "caption": "一笔订单，应该到账 10 积分", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-expected", "scene_id": "intro", "target": "i-expected", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 3870, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "expected", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "expected", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "actual", "scene_id": "intro", "planned_start_ms": 3870, "planned_end_ms": 8944, "text": "余额却涨了二十。流水里有两笔相同的加分。", "caption": "实际 +20，积分流水有两笔 +10", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-actual", "scene_id": "intro", "target": "i-real", "planned_start_ms": 3870, "planned_end_ms": 8944, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "actual", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "actual", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "same-id", "scene_id": "intro", "planned_start_ms": 8944, "planned_end_ms": 14792, "text": "再看事件编号，两笔都写着四十二。同一条消息处理了两次。", "caption": "两个记录都来自事件 E-42", "source_ids": ["retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-same-id", "scene_id": "intro", "target": "i-card", "planned_start_ms": 8944, "planned_end_ms": 14792, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "same-id", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "same-id", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "follow", "scene_id": "intro", "planned_start_ms": 14792, "planned_end_ms": 19608, "text": "跟着这条消息走一遍，看看为什么会重投。", "caption": "跟着 E-42，看第二次投递从哪来", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-follow", "scene_id": "intro", "target": "i-question", "planned_start_ms": 14792, "planned_end_ms": 19608, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "follow", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "follow", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "delivery", "kind": "html", "title": "投递只是把消息交给消费者"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "publish", "scene_id": "delivery", "planned_start_ms": 20058, "planned_end_ms": 25390, "text": "订单服务把消息四十二放进队列，内容是给小林加十积分。", "caption": "订单服务发布 E-42，给小林加 10 积分", "source_ids": ["retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-publish", "scene_id": "delivery", "target": "a-file", "planned_start_ms": 20058, "planned_end_ms": 25390, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "publish", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "publish", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "dispatch", "scene_id": "delivery", "planned_start_ms": 25390, "planned_end_ms": 30894, "text": "队列把它交给积分服务，这一步叫投递。业务还没处理完。", "caption": "投递完成，业务等待处理", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-dispatch", "scene_id": "delivery", "target": "a-file", "planned_start_ms": 25390, "planned_end_ms": 30894, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "dispatch", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "dispatch", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "write", "scene_id": "delivery", "planned_start_ms": 30894, "planned_end_ms": 36742, "text": "积分服务先写数据库。这里用手动确认，队列还在等回执。", "caption": "先写数据库，队列等待手动确认", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-write", "scene_id": "delivery", "target": "a-consumer", "planned_start_ms": 30894, "planned_end_ms": 36742, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "write", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "write", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "receipt", "scene_id": "delivery", "planned_start_ms": 36742, "planned_end_ms": 43192, "text": "确认发出去，队列收到以后，这次投递才算结束。消息可以移除了。", "caption": "队列收到 ACK，消息可以移除", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-receipt", "scene_id": "delivery", "target": "a-ack", "planned_start_ms": 36742, "planned_end_ms": 43192, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "receipt", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "receipt", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "crash", "kind": "html", "title": "数据库提交与回执之间"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "commit", "scene_id": "crash", "planned_start_ms": 43642, "planned_end_ms": 48544, "text": "换个时机。数据库已经提交，余额加了十。", "caption": "数据库已提交，余额 +10", "source_ids": ["transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-commit", "scene_id": "crash", "target": "f-write", "planned_start_ms": 43642, "planned_end_ms": 48544, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "commit", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "commit", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "missing", "scene_id": "crash", "planned_start_ms": 48544, "planned_end_ms": 54134, "text": "确认还没送到，积分服务突然崩了。数据库提交和队列确认是两件事。", "caption": "进程崩溃，ACK 未送达", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-missing", "scene_id": "crash", "target": "f-ack", "planned_start_ms": 48544, "planned_end_ms": 54134, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "missing", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "missing", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "queue-view", "scene_id": "crash", "planned_start_ms": 54134, "planned_end_ms": 60670, "text": "队列只知道连接断开，还有一条没确认的消息。积分是否到账，它不知道。", "caption": "队列看到断连和未确认消息", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-queue-view", "scene_id": "crash", "target": "f-status", "planned_start_ms": 54134, "planned_end_ms": 60670, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "queue-view", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "queue-view", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "requeue", "scene_id": "crash", "planned_start_ms": 60670, "planned_end_ms": 67120, "text": "连接关闭后，没确认的消息会回到队列，等待重投。", "caption": "未确认的 E-42 回到队列", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-requeue", "scene_id": "crash", "target": "f-file", "planned_start_ms": 60670, "planned_end_ms": 67120, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "requeue", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "requeue", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "repeat", "kind": "html", "title": "同一事件可以只生效一次"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "duplicate", "scene_id": "repeat", "planned_start_ms": 67570, "planned_end_ms": 73074, "text": "第二个消费者又收到了四十二，任务还是加十积分。", "caption": "同一个 E-42 再次投递", "source_ids": ["retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-duplicate", "scene_id": "repeat", "target": "r-copy2", "planned_start_ms": 67570, "planned_end_ms": 73074, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "duplicate", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "duplicate", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "at-least", "scene_id": "repeat", "planned_start_ms": 73074, "planned_end_ms": 78836, "text": "至少一次投递里，重试会把没确认的消息再送达，所以同一条可能来多次。", "caption": "至少一次投递允许同一条消息再次送达", "source_ids": ["ack", "retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-at-least", "scene_id": "repeat", "target": "r-guideline", "planned_start_ms": 73074, "planned_end_ms": 78836, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "at-least", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "at-least", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "unsafe", "scene_id": "repeat", "planned_start_ms": 78836, "planned_end_ms": 85114, "text": "每次收到就加十，两次就加二十。开头多的积分就这么来的。", "caption": "每次都加 10，两次就加 20", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-unsafe", "scene_id": "repeat", "target": "r-risk", "planned_start_ms": 78836, "planned_end_ms": 85114, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "unsafe", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "unsafe", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "idempotent", "scene_id": "repeat", "planned_start_ms": 85114, "planned_end_ms": 92596, "text": "幂等就是同一事件重做一遍，结果跟只做一遍一样。这里就是积分只加一次。", "caption": "幂等目标：同一事件只生效一次", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-idempotent", "scene_id": "repeat", "target": "r-lesson", "planned_start_ms": 85114, "planned_end_ms": 92596, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "idempotent", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "idempotent", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "unique", "kind": "html", "title": "让数据库认得同一个事件"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "unique-key", "scene_id": "unique", "planned_start_ms": 93046, "planned_end_ms": 99582, "text": "把事件编号写进积分流水，给编号加唯一约束。一个编号只允许一条记录。", "caption": "事件编号写入流水，并设置唯一约束", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-unique-key", "scene_id": "unique", "target": "g-key", "planned_start_ms": 93046, "planned_end_ms": 99582, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "unique-key", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "unique-key", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "insert-first", "scene_id": "unique", "planned_start_ms": 99582, "planned_end_ms": 105258, "text": "第一次收到四十二，插入成功，多了一条十积分的流水。", "caption": "第一次插入 E-42，写入一条 +10 流水", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-insert-first", "scene_id": "unique", "target": "g-insert", "planned_start_ms": 99582, "planned_end_ms": 105258, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "insert-first", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "insert-first", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "conflict", "scene_id": "unique", "planned_start_ms": 105258, "planned_end_ms": 111536, "text": "再来一个四十二，插入碰到冲突。数据库跳过，第二条记录就写不进去了。", "caption": "再次插入 E-42，冲突时跳过", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-conflict", "scene_id": "unique", "target": "g-retry", "planned_start_ms": 105258, "planned_end_ms": 111536, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "conflict", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "conflict", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "one-row", "scene_id": "unique", "planned_start_ms": 111536, "planned_end_ms": 117900, "text": "队列投了两次，流水只有一条。两次处理用的是同一个事件编号。", "caption": "2 次投递，1 条积分流水", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-one-row", "scene_id": "unique", "target": "g-count", "planned_start_ms": 111536, "planned_end_ms": 117900, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "one-row", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "one-row", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "transaction", "kind": "html", "title": "流水和余额一起提交"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "both", "scene_id": "transaction", "planned_start_ms": 118350, "planned_end_ms": 125058, "text": "如果还有一张余额表，流水和余额要一起更新。把两次写入放进同一个事务。", "caption": "积分流水和余额更新放在同一个事务", "source_ids": ["transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-both", "scene_id": "transaction", "target": "t-writes", "planned_start_ms": 118350, "planned_end_ms": 125058, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "both", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "both", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "row-gate", "scene_id": "transaction", "planned_start_ms": 125058, "planned_end_ms": 131164, "text": "只有新增了流水，才更新余额。遇到重复、没有新增记录，就跳过余额更新。", "caption": "只有新写入流水时才更新余额", "source_ids": ["insert", "transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-row-gate", "scene_id": "transaction", "target": "t-balance", "planned_start_ms": 125058, "planned_end_ms": 131164, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "row-gate", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "row-gate", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "returned-rows", "scene_id": "transaction", "planned_start_ms": 131164, "planned_end_ms": 136754, "text": "用插入语句返回的行数判断。只在返回了新行时，才执行余额更新。", "caption": "RETURNING 有返回行，才更新余额", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-returned-rows", "scene_id": "transaction", "target": "t-return", "planned_start_ms": 131164, "planned_end_ms": 136754, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "returned-rows", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "returned-rows", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "rollback", "scene_id": "transaction", "planned_start_ms": 136754, "planned_end_ms": 143806, "text": "中途出错，两次写入一起回滚。这样下次重试还能重新写入。", "caption": "失败就一起回滚，避免流水和余额不一致", "source_ids": ["transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-rollback", "scene_id": "transaction", "target": "t-rollback", "planned_start_ms": 136754, "planned_end_ms": 143806, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "rollback", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "rollback", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "race", "scene_id": "transaction", "planned_start_ms": 143806, "planned_end_ms": 150772, "text": "两个消费者同时处理，也由数据库的唯一约束来裁决。", "caption": "并发时让数据库唯一约束裁决", "source_ids": ["insert"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-race", "scene_id": "transaction", "target": "t-concurrent", "planned_start_ms": 143806, "planned_end_ms": 150772, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "race", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "race", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "order", "kind": "html", "title": "确认应当放在什么时候"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "early", "scene_id": "order", "planned_start_ms": 151222, "planned_end_ms": 157328, "text": "先确认，再写数据库呢？中间如果崩溃，队列认为已完成，积分可能没到账。", "caption": "先 ACK 再写入，崩溃可能漏加积分", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-early", "scene_id": "order", "target": "o-bad", "planned_start_ms": 151222, "planned_end_ms": 157328, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "early", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "early", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "late", "scene_id": "order", "planned_start_ms": 157328, "planned_end_ms": 163864, "text": "让事务先提交，再发确认。提交后就算崩了，重投会撞上已有编号，余额不会再加。", "caption": "先提交，再 ACK；重投时用同一个编号去重", "source_ids": ["ack", "transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-late", "scene_id": "order", "target": "o-good", "planned_start_ms": 157328, "planned_end_ms": 163864, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "late", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "late", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "ack-repeat", "scene_id": "order", "planned_start_ms": 163864, "planned_end_ms": 170658, "text": "确认是投递的完成信号。重投时核实结果已经提交，也可以确认它。", "caption": "已确认业务结果的重投，也可以 ACK", "source_ids": ["ack", "retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-ack-repeat", "scene_id": "order", "target": "o-repeat", "planned_start_ms": 163864, "planned_end_ms": 170658, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "ack-repeat", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "ack-repeat", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "ending", "kind": "html", "title": "从编号、事务、确认三处检查"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "stable", "scene_id": "ending", "planned_start_ms": 171108, "planned_end_ms": 176440, "text": "先核对编号。同一业务事件重试，就沿用原来的编号。", "caption": "重试沿用原事件编号", "source_ids": ["retry"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-stable", "scene_id": "ending", "target": "e-id", "planned_start_ms": 171108, "planned_end_ms": 176440, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "stable", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "stable", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "database", "scene_id": "ending", "planned_start_ms": 176440, "planned_end_ms": 181514, "text": "再看数据库。用唯一约束挡重复，相关的写入用同一个事务。", "caption": "唯一约束挡重复，事务保存一致性", "source_ids": ["insert", "transactions"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-database", "scene_id": "ending", "target": "e-db", "planned_start_ms": 176440, "planned_end_ms": 181514, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "database", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "database", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "finish-ack", "scene_id": "ending", "planned_start_ms": 181514, "planned_end_ms": 185986, "text": "最后看确认时机。等结果落地，再告诉队列这次完成。", "caption": "业务结果落地，再发 ACK", "source_ids": ["ack"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-finish-ack", "scene_id": "ending", "target": "e-ack", "planned_start_ms": 181514, "planned_end_ms": 185986, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "finish-ack", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "finish-ack", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "final", "scene_id": "ending", "planned_start_ms": 185986, "planned_end_ms": 192522, "text": "回到小林这笔订单。消息到两次，流水只有一条，积分只加十，这就是幂等消费。", "caption": "投递 2 次，流水 1 条，积分 +10", "source_ids": []}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "m-final", "scene_id": "ending", "target": "e-total", "planned_start_ms": 185986, "planned_end_ms": 192522, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "final", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "final", "point": "end"}}
